Garden: Plantings 2008

2007 or 2008: Corylus avellana 'contorted', “Harry lauder's Walking stick”, by garage, next to walkway to garden.
2007 or 2008, planted 2 Honeysuckle,“halls”, on either side of back porch stairs. (Direct Gardening). By 2009, they are covering the trellises there and are cold hardy. Many perfumed flowers in Spring.";}s:8:"internal";a:2:{s:5:"cache";b:1;s:3:"toc";b:1;}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}}s:10:"persistent";a:5:{s:4:"date";a:3:{i:0;N;s:7:"created";i:1204072118;s:8:"modified";i:1739744245;}s:7:"creator";s:21:"Melissa Clepper-Faith";s:11:"last_change";a:8:{s:4:"date";i:1739744245;s:2:"ip";s:13:"64.181.84.152";s:4:"type";s:1:"E";s:2:"id";s:16:"garden:plantings";s:4:"user";s:3:"mcf";s:3:"sum";s:7:"[2025] ";s:5:"extra";s:0:"";s:10:"sizechange";i:1;}s:11:"contributor";a:3:{i:0;N;s:3:"mcf";s:21:"Melissa Clepper-Faith";s:5:"faith";s:9:"Rik Faith";}s:4:"user";s:0:"";}}